//RS /// Real facts read from `DevStatus`'s live snapshot. `WebHost` owns
//RS /// `DevStatus` privately, so this is the minimal typed handoff instead of a
//RS /// visibility change or a module cycle. Fields mirror `DevStatusSnapshot`
//RS /// exactly: `code`/`diagnostic` are empty for every state but `"error"`,
//RS /// matching `DevStatus::mark_error`'s own invariant, and no rendered text is
//RS /// re-parsed to recover them.
